# The double game's spike level, "Upstairs Downstairs" (levels/duo/d1.txt), for
# `NATHAN_DUO=1 scripts/record-run --capture out.mp4 scripts/tours/duo-1.timeline` and
# tests/duo.rs. Nat up top, Han running down below.
t=0.1 press Right
# Four quick nuggets: fired up's charged. Down calls it, for Han's pit.
t=2.0 tap Down
# Hop the brushes (fired up: fast feet).
t=3.70 tap Space 150ms
t=4.33 tap Space 150ms
t=4.96 tap Space 150ms
# Over the hole Han climbs up through, then four more nuggets (fired up keeps going).
t=6.45 tap Space 150ms
# Down the drop (holding Right drifts Nat past the pit under it). Brushes down here.
t=9.05 tap Space 150ms
# Up the steps and through the hole Han falls down.
t=9.55 tap Space 150ms
t=9.85 tap Space 150ms
t=10.15 tap Space 150ms
t=10.50 tap Space 150ms
t=11.00 tap Space 200ms
t=11.24 tap Space 150ms
# Checkpoint, then the blind jump: onto the ledge hidden behind the bandstand.
t=12.60 tap Space 150ms
t=13.15 tap Space 200ms
t=13.42 tap Space 150ms
at 19
